{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年度！\nということで我が社にも新入社員が\n3名入ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなぺーぺーの私が\n先輩になってしまうんですね！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に上手く答えられるかな...\n仲良く出来るかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安は募るばかりですが、\n楽しい職場になるよう\n今年度も頑張ります(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも新生活スタートしたかな？？？\nドキドキわくわくなコメント\n待ってますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はレギュラーラジオ\nOL兼任アイドル新内眞衣の\nまいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の初回放送(open)日でした〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかー？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに若様が来てくれたので\nだいぶ緊張が和らぎました（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人喋りなんてアンダーライブの\n企画でしかやった事ないから、\nまだまだ聞き辛いラジオだったかと\n思います、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも皆さんからのメールは\n本当に支えになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんメールありがとうございます！\nそして感想も良かったら\n教えて下さいm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回放送日は4/8です！\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ゴルバチョフ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46カフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだまた出勤して来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水曜日に行ったので\nレディースディだったよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた女の子達とたくさん\nお話できて楽しかった〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの日は伊織も来てくれたので\n壁のサインが1つ増えました〜！\n順調♩順調♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも私に遭遇しましたら、\nたくさんお話しましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週のスペシャルドリンクは\n日曜日までです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日からはまた新たなドリンクに\nなりますのでお楽しみに*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！\n昨日は4/1ということで\nエイプリルフールでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/1といったら入社式しか\n頭に浮かばないOLな私ですが、\n今年はまあやに騙されました！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いナチュラルな告白だったので\n全然気づかなかった！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話の途中で純奈とまあやが\nくすくす笑ってるのにも\n全然気づかなかった！(◎_◎;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年は私が騙してやるんだから！\nもう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週末は京都と名古屋で握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりだから緊張しちゃうな..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/04/03/8759372/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}